    feat(footer): SFCC-55 global footer UI — atoms, molecules, subscribe modal, and Figma token alignment

    Scaffold global footer component with responsive four-column desktop layout,
    tablet/mobile stacked layout, and full dark/inverse theme across all breakpoints.

    UI kit atoms added:
    - ZimmButton: primary/secondary/icon variants, large/medium sizes, light/inverse modes
    - ZimmNavItem: underline-on-hover navigation link with active/focus states
    - ZimmTextInput: flush floating-label input with hover/filled/focus border states
    - ZimmIcon: centralised SVG icon set (Zimmermann custom + base PWA)
    - ZimmInputAction molecule: text input with trailing icon-button for subscribe entry point

    Subscribe modal (HPC-035, HPC-037): first name, last name, email, privacy consent checkbox.
    Marked as placeholder pending HPC-036 Omneo integration.

